{"id":9601,"date":"2025-10-08T11:17:52","date_gmt":"2025-10-08T11:17:52","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/?p=9601"},"modified":"2025-10-08T11:17:59","modified_gmt":"2025-10-08T11:17:59","slug":"how-much-does-pest-control-in-melbourne-cost-in-2026","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/how-much-does-pest-control-in-melbourne-cost-in-2026\/","title":{"rendered":"How Much Does Pest Control in Melbourne Cost in 2026?"},"content":{"rendered":"<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">In Melbourne, homes and businesses are increasingly facing pest problems that can affect health, property, and hygiene.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">From <\/span><b>bed bugs<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> in bedrooms to rodents in commercial spaces, infestations can escalate quickly if left untreated. Pest infestations are not just a nuisance\u2014they pose serious risks, including <\/span><b>property damage<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, food contamination, and potential health issues.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Professional <\/span><b>pest control Melbourne<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> services are essential for addressing these problems efficiently and safely.\u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">This blog breaks down <\/span><b>2026 pest control costs<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> for various pests, helping homeowners and businesses understand pricing and plan effective treatment plans to maintain a <\/span><b>pest-free<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> environment.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9604\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-10-01-at-2.38.18-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"pest control melbourne \" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-10-01-at-2.38.18-PM-300x300.jpeg 300w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-10-01-at-2.38.18-PM-150x150.jpeg 150w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-10-01-at-2.38.18-PM-768x768.jpeg 768w, https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-10-01-at-2.38.18-PM.jpeg 1024w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" \/><\/p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Factors That Affect Pest Control Costs in Melbourne<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">The cost of pest control depends on several factors:<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Property size and type:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Larger homes or commercial properties often require more extensive treatment, which increases costs.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Type of pest:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Different pests\u2014such as bed bugs, rodents, termites, ants, cockroaches, spiders, mosquitoes, and wasps\u2014require specialised treatments.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Level of infestation:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Severe infestations require multiple visits and longer treatment plans.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Treatment type:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Eco-friendly methods may cost more initially but offer safe, long-term results.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><b>Service frequency:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> One-off treatments are less expensive than ongoing maintenance plans.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Understanding these factors can help you make informed decisions when seeking <\/span><b>pest control solutions<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<h3><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bed Bugs Control Cost in Melbourne 2026<\/span><\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Bed bugs are notoriously difficult to eliminate. They hide in mattresses, furniture, and small crevices, making infestations hard to detect and treat.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Health risks from bed bugs include:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Itchy bites and skin irritation<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Disrupted sleep<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Allergic reactions in sensitive individuals<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$319<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Effective treatment requires <\/span><b>customised treatment plans<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> to target eggs and adult bugs, ensuring long-term results. Eco-friendly options are available for households concerned about chemical exposure.<\/span><\/p>\n<h4><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rodent Control Cost in Melbourne 2026<\/span><\/h4>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rodents are more than just a nuisance\u2014they can cause significant <\/span><b>property damage<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and health risks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Common issues include:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Chewed wires and structural damage<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Food contamination<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spread of diseases<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Signs of infestation:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Scratching or squeaking noises in walls, droppings, or gnaw marks.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$169<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> A long-term rodent control plan helps prevent repeat infestations and protects both homes and businesses.<\/span><\/p>\n<h5><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Termite Control &amp; Inspection Costs<\/span><\/h5>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Termites are one of Melbourne\u2019s most destructive pests. They can silently damage timber structures, leading to costly repairs.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Key points:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Regular inspections are crucial to detect infestations early.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Treatment costs vary depending on the severity of the infestation and property size.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$219+<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Investing in termite inspections and preventive treatments saves substantial money in the long term and protects property value.<\/span><\/p>\n<h6><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ant Control Cost<\/span><\/h6>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Ants are common in kitchens, pantries, and gardens. Colonies can be hard to eliminate, making early treatment essential.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$149\u2013$169<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b> <b>Prevention tips:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Seal entry points and maintain clean surfaces to reduce the risk of infestations. Professional treatment ensures long-term control and avoids recurring issues.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Cockroach Control Cost<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Melbourne\u2019s humid climate makes it ideal for cockroaches, which can spread bacteria and compromise hygiene.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$219<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b> <b>Treatment options:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Eco-friendly sprays and baits provide safe solutions for homes and commercial spaces, while ongoing monitoring prevents future infestations.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Spider Control Cost<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Melbourne is home to both venomous and harmless spiders, requiring different approaches for effective control.<\/span><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">General sprays are suitable for minor infestations.<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Targeted treatments are necessary for venomous or persistent populations.<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$219<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><b>Additional measures:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Web removal and regular inspections help prevent <\/span><b>future infestations<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mosquito Pest Control Cost<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mosquitoes are most active during the warmer months and can transmit diseases while causing irritation through bites.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$219<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Ongoing treatments may be required in high-risk areas, particularly in commercial or outdoor settings.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasp Control &amp; Removal Cost<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Wasps can be dangerous, making DIY removal risky. Professional pest control ensures safe removal and prevents stings.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Cost:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Starting from only <\/span><b>$169<\/b><b><br \/>\n<\/b> <b>Benefits:<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Safe, effective solutions minimise risk and reduce the likelihood of returning nests.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Summary of Pest Control Treatment Cost in Melbourne 2026<\/b><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Below is the updated price list for pest control services in Melbourne for 2026, covering the most common residential and commercial pest treatments.<\/span><\/p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Pest Control Services<\/b><\/td>\n<td><b>Pest Control Cost<\/b><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Termite Inspection<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $219<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Residential Rodent Treatment<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $169 (Quick Response Time)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Wasp Removal<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $169<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Mosquito Control<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $219<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Ant Treatments<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $149\u2013$169 (Full Internal &amp; External Treatment)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Cockroach Treatment<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $219<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Spider Control<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $219<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Bed Bugs Control<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $319<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Bird &amp; Solar Panel Proofing<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Starting from $349<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Same-Day Pest Control<\/b><\/td>\n<td><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Great Price $129 (Most Affordable Service)<\/span><\/td>\n<\/tr>\n<\/tbody>\n<\/table>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">These are estimated starting prices for standard residential treatments.<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> Commercial pest control pricing may vary depending on the scale of the property, infestation level, and treatment frequency.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Commercial Pest Control Costs in Melbourne<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Businesses face unique challenges when it comes to pest management, and costs vary according to property size, infestation severity, and industry type.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><b>Industries requiring professional pest control include:<\/b><\/p>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hospitality and food services<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Retail spaces<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Warehouses and storage facilities<\/span><\/li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" aria-level=\"1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Offices<\/span><\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Commercial pest control services provide <\/span><b>reliable pest control<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> solutions and help maintain compliance with hygiene standards. Pricing is usually customised, based on the property and the treatment required.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Why Choose a Professional Pest Control Company in Melbourne?<\/span><\/p>\n<p><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-9603\" src=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/10\/WhatsApp-Image-2025-10-01-at-2.39.30-PM-300x300.jpeg\" alt=\"pest control melbourne \" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" srcset=\"https:\/\/7statespestcontrol.com.au\/wp-content\/uploa